    "description": "Mean daily temperature high in July (period 2070-2099). The temperature increase of the climate scenario was added to the map «Air temperature July 1981-2010». Among the representative concentration pathways, RCP 2.6 with the model combination DMI_HIRHAM_ECEARTH_EUR11 was selected as a projection for slight climate change (NCCS 2018; Provision of the data by Remund et al. 2020) to calculate the temperature increase in the future. The resulting map has a spatial resolution of 25 m x 25 m. It was used for modelling altitudinal belts of forest vegetation.",
